{
  "_about": "Curated search vocabulary for the tool directories. groups are interchangeable words (each expands to the others). expand is one-way: the key also matches the listed words or season months (m1..m12). Keep words single and lowercase; ambiguous mappings (fall -> autumn months, falls -> waterfall) are deliberately omitted. Rebuild with: python3 scripts/build-hub-search.py",
